  id: tutorial_orders
  displayName: Give orders
  order: 40
  body: 'Press {Mine} and paint over the soil where you want a tunnel. The orange stripes are mining orders: your workers dig them out for you.


    Orders can reach into the dark, so you can plan ahead. Right drag erases them.'
